# 6. Merchant review via WhatsApp

## 6.1 Review batching

Send one section at a time:

> Section: Shawarma — 8 items found. Reply with `approve all`, or tell me the item number to edit.

Example:

```text
1. Chicken Shawarma — $6.00
2. Meat Shawarma — $7.00
3. Family Shawarma — $24.00
4. Extra Garlic — $1.00
```

Buttons where possible:

```text
Approve section
Edit items
Skip section
Open portal
```

## 6.2 Merchant corrections

Support:

```text
2 price 7.5
3 remove onions as option
4 out of stock
add 2 chicken shawarma 6 dollars
```

The backend should parse these into typed actions and show a confirmation summary before changing the draft.

## 6.3 Final publication confirmation

Show:

```text
Items to publish
Prices and currency
Options
Unresolved warnings
Allergen review status
Menu effective time
```

Require:

```text
Publish menu
```

If unresolved prices or required options remain, block publication or publish only a safe subset with clear warnings.

