# 7. Extraction versioning and rollback

Every menu publication should create a version:

```text
menu_versions
menu_version_items
menu_extraction_jobs
menu_extraction_sources
menu_review_events
```

Store:

```text
version_id
vendor_id
source_file_ids
created_by
approved_by
published_at
supersedes_version_id
```

A merchant must be able to:

- compare current and previous menus;
- restore a previous version;
- see who changed a price;
- undo a bulk extraction;
- export the published menu.

Do not delete historical prices from confirmed orders.

