# 8. Extraction failure and safety paths

## Blurry image

> The menu photo is too blurry to read prices reliably. Please send a brighter, closer photo or use the portal to enter the prices manually.

## Cropped page

> This page looks cut off. Please send the full page so I don’t publish incomplete items.

## Conflicting prices

> I found two prices for Chicken Shawarma: $6 and $7. Which one should be active?

## Menu has no prices

Create item drafts with `price_required` and do not enable ordering for those items.

## Menu changes while an order is active

New prices apply to future orders. Confirmed orders retain their original server-priced totals.

## Model unavailable

Keep the upload in `processing_failed` with a retry button. Do not publish partial, unvalidated extraction.

