# 14. How a customer sees unavailable zones

If no active merchant and driver exist:

> Alo King is building delivery coverage in **[Area]**. We can show you nearby directory listings, but ordering is not available there yet.

If merchants exist but no driver:

> We found restaurants in **[Area]**, but delivery is temporarily unavailable because no Alo King driver is covering the area right now. You can join the notification list.

If a driver exists but no verified merchant:

> Delivery coverage is nearly ready in **[Area]**. We still need a verified restaurant with a live menu before orders can open.

Never show an **Order** button for an inactive zone.

## Waitlist

Allow customers to:

```text
Notify me when ordering opens
Suggest a business
Share my area
```

Store consent separately from marketing consent. A zone alert is not automatically permission for promotional broadcasts.

