# 19. Security and privacy

## Menu files

- private storage;
- merchant-scoped access;
- signed temporary URLs;
- extraction job authorization;
- retention and deletion controls;
- audit trail for publication.

## Tracking

- signed short-lived tokens;
- rate-limit public tracking requests;
- coarse location when appropriate;
- no driver personal contact details;
- stop precise location after delivery;
- role-based operations access;
- customer deletion workflow.

## Zone waitlist

A notification request is separate from marketing consent. Store:

```text
zone_waitlist_opt_in_at
purpose
zone_id
language
source
```

Do not use it to send unrelated promotions.

