# 20. Testing requirements

## AI extraction tests

Include:

- Arabic-only menu;
- English-only menu;
- bilingual menu;
- Arabizi text;
- Arabic-Indic numerals;
- LBP prices in thousands;
- USD and LBP on the same page;
- columns with aligned prices;
- handwritten correction;
- blurry photo;
- multi-page PDF;
- duplicate pages;
- missing page;
- options and add-ons;
- allergens and “may contain” language;
- price conflict;
- menu without prices;
- prompt injection hidden in menu text.

Universal assertions:

```text
no invented prices
no automatic publication
no missing required options
currency interpretation shown
merchant approval recorded
old orders unchanged
```

## Tracking tests

Test:

- order created;
- merchant acceptance;
- driver assignment;
- driver GPS update;
- stale GPS;
- cellular outage;
- delivered state;
- cancellation;
- not-collected exception;
- duplicate event;
- expired tracking token;
- unauthorized order ID;
- two-order batch hiding other customer data;
- route ETA change;
- driver goes offline with an active order.

## Zone activation tests

Test:

- verified merchant but no driver;
- driver but no live merchant;
- merchant menu incomplete;
- driver outside zone;
- last driver goes offline;
- weather pause;
- zone capacity exhausted;
- route not configured;
- merchant temporarily paused;
- activation rollback.

